# What EAS Build uploads.
#
# ⚠⚠ THIS FILE REPLACES EVERY .gitignore, IT DOES NOT ADD TO THEM. Expo's docs
# are explicit: "if it is present, none of the existing .gitignore files will be
# respected by EAS CLI." So anything missing here gets uploaded — including
# node_modules (2 GB) and, far worse, signing keys and env files. Read the whole
# file before changing one line of it.
#
# Why it exists: the RN app lives in `mobile/`, but EAS archives from the GIT
# ROOT, so every build was uploading the Next.js web app, the Swift app in
# `ios/`, and ~230 MB of avatar source art in `assets/`. The archive came to
# 610 MB and took 12m 24s to upload, for a build that reads none of it — EAS
# itself flagged the size and pointed here.
#
# ⚠ `mobile/` IS STANDALONE, which is what makes the whitelist below safe: it
# has its own package.json, its own package-lock.json and its own .npmrc, and
# the root package.json declares no workspaces. Nothing under `mobile/` imports
# outside itself — `@/*` resolves to `./*`, and the few mentions of
# `assets/showdown-storyboard` in that tree are comments, not imports.
#
# ⚠ NOT SUPPORTED WITH `"requireCommit": true` in eas.json, which switches EAS
# to `git clone` and ignores this file entirely. It is not set today; if it ever
# is, this file silently stops working and the 610 MB comes back.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Exclude the entire repository root, then re-admit only the app.
#
# A whitelist rather than a list of exclusions, deliberately: the failure mode
# of a forgotten exclusion is a secret being uploaded, and the failure mode of a
# forgotten inclusion is a build error that says exactly what is missing. Only
# one of those is quiet.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*
!/mobile/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Inside mobile/ — everything mobile/.gitignore excluded, carried over by hand
# because it is no longer read.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Dependencies and build output. The build server installs from
# mobile/package-lock.json; uploading node_modules would add ~1.3 GB.
mobile/node_modules/
mobile/.expo/
mobile/dist/
mobile/web-build/
mobile/.kotlin/
mobile/expo-env.d.ts
mobile/*.tsbuildinfo

# ⚠ SECRETS. These were excluded before only because mobile/.gitignore said so,
# and that file is now ignored. Losing a line here uploads a signing key.
mobile/.env*
mobile/*.jks
mobile/*.p8
mobile/*.p12
mobile/*.key
mobile/*.mobileprovision
mobile/*.pem

# Local noise.
mobile/.DS_Store
mobile/**/.DS_Store
mobile/*.orig.*
mobile/.metro-health-check*
mobile/npm-debug.*
mobile/yarn-debug.*
mobile/yarn-error.*
